SDL-E1036 (spec/api.md)

  x duplicate method `get` — each method may appear in only one group
   ,----
 1 | api '/x' { get { then: 1; }; get { then: 2; }; };
   :                              ^|^
   :                               `-- method already grouped
   `----
  help: merge the groups — `get, delete { … };` — or give each method its own group; a method may appear in only one
